<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Ashaka Cement Q1 profit falls.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Ashaka Cement Q1 profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter unaudited result for Nigeria's Ashaka Cement Company Plc to February 28, 1997. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1997	 1996</p>
<p>     Turnover		 821.7	772.5</p>
<p>     Profit before tax    176.2	239.6</p>
<p>     Taxation		  54.2	 79.0</p>
<p>     Profit after tax     121.9     160.75</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
